    { math: '3 · Corroborate with documents', note: 'Data, records, satellite imagery, receipts. Claims about money are checked against filings; claims about places against maps.' },
    { math: '4 · Seek comment', note: 'The subject of a critical story gets the allegations, with time to respond. Their answer — or refusal — becomes part of the story.' },
    { math: '5 · Publish with uncertainty', note: 'Say what is known, what is claimed, and by whom. Then correct visibly when wrong: the correction page is a newsroom\'s character.' },
